  "details": "I got some extra little knobs and dials on my remote here that are going fairly un-used...\n\nIt would be really convenient to be able to bind any of these to the cameras zoom/FOV slider (and aperture as well now that I'm thinking about it). Currently if I'm flying the drone and need to change zoom on the fly, there's just no way. You have to back out, put down the controller, grab your mouse, go in and adjust it, pick up the controller again, figure out where the drone flew off or what it crashed into while you were adjusting the zoom, and then get back to your shot and pray you didn't miss the moment.",
